  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The property would be not suitable for conversion to a HMO as the original floor space would be less than 130 square metres, would not be located within 400 metres of a town centre, and would not be located in an area with good access to public transportation. The proposal is therefore unacceptable in principle, contrary to Local Plan policy SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPG.",
    "Reason : 2 - The application has failed to demonstrate that the proposal would not result in increased disturbance to residents of neighbouring properties contrary to Local Plan policy SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPG.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal would provide a cramped and substandard internal accommodation, contrary to Local Plan policy SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPG"
